  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fund</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Verod Fund III is the second fund being raised by Verod Capital to invest in West African SMEs. The fund manager has built a strong investment track record over the last decade and typically invests in consumer goods and services sectors, agribusiness, and financial services, with investment themes centred around regional expansion and import substitution.</narrative>
  </description>
